    "segments": [
      {
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 80.0,
        "text": "教师：同学们好，今天我们从生活中的抛物线开始，认识二次函数。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "课堂导入",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 95.0,
        "end": 175.0,
        "text": "教师：回顾上节课学习的一次函数，它的图像有什么特点？",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "课堂导入",
        "question": true,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 190.0,
        "end": 270.0,
        "text": "学生：一次函数的图像是一条直线。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "student",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 285.0,
        "end": 365.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，如果把一次项变成平方项，图像会发生什么变化？",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": true,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 380.0,
        "end": 460.0,
        "text": "教师：请观察函数 y=x² 的表达式，自变量可以取任意实数。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 475.0,
        "end": 555.0,
        "text": "教师：我们先建立平面直角坐标系，标出横轴与纵轴的单位。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 570.0,
        "end": 650.0,
        "text": "教师：然后，取 -3 到 3 的整数，分别求出对应的函数值。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 665.0,
        "end": 745.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，将这些点在坐标系中描出，注意坐标的正负号。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 760.0,
        "end": 840.0,
        "text": "教师：用平滑的曲线连接这些点，就得到一条抛物线。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 855.0,
        "end": 935.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，这条曲线具有轴对称的性质，对称轴是 y 轴。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 950.0,
        "end": 1030.0,
        "text": "教师：当 x=0 时，函数取到最小值，原点称为顶点。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1045.0,
        "end": 1125.0,
        "text": "教师：然后，我们观察 y=2x² 与 y=x² 的差异。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1140.0,
        "end": 1220.0,
        "text": "教师：系数绝对值增大，抛物线的开口变窄，这一点要注意。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1235.0,
        "end": 1315.0,
        "text": "教师：接下来比较 y=-x²，开口方向向下，对不对？",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": true,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1330.0,
        "end": 1410.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，系数的正负决定开口方向，绝对值影响开口大小。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 15,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1425.0,
        "end": 1505.0,
        "text": "教师：在顶点左侧和右侧，函数值的变化趋势不同。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 16,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1520.0,
        "end": 1600.0,
        "text": "教师：我们可以通过列表、描点、连线三个步骤作图。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 17,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1615.0,
        "end": 1695.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，请独立完成练习一，画出 y=0.5x² 的图像。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 18,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "练习巩固",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1710.0,
        "end": 1790.0,
        "text": "学生：老师，我画的图像比 y=x² 更宽。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 19,
        "speaker": "student",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1805.0,
        "end": 1885.0,
        "text": "教师：这个观察很好。你认为是什么决定了开口大小？请分享依据。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 20,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "探究互动",
        "question": true,
        "interaction": true
      },
      {
        "start": 1900.0,
        "end": 1980.0,
        "text": "学生：系数的绝对值小于一，所以开口更宽。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 21,
        "speaker": "student",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 1995.0,
        "end": 2075.0,
        "text": "教师：然后完成练习二，比较三个函数的开口方向。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 22,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "练习巩固",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 2090.0,
        "end": 2170.0,
        "text": "教师：请计算当 x=2 时三个函数的值，并检查符号。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 23,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "练习巩固",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 2185.0,
        "end": 2265.0,
        "text": "教师：那么，作图时不要把抛物线画成折线。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 24,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "知识讲授",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 2280.0,
        "end": 2360.0,
        "text": "教师：这节课我们总结二次函数的开口、顶点与对称轴。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 25,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "总结回顾",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      },
      {
        "start": 2375.0,
        "end": 2455.0,
        "text": "教师：请用一句话归纳系数 a 对函数图像的影响，下课。",
        "timing": "provided",
        "id": 26,
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "stage": "总结回顾",
        "question": false,
        "interaction": false
      }
